{"id":184,"date":"2020-05-06T14:44:49","date_gmt":"2020-05-06T11:44:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/artielektrik.net\/?p=184"},"modified":"2020-05-18T10:05:23","modified_gmt":"2020-05-18T07:05:23","slug":"bina-topraklama-hizmeti-edirne","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/artielektrik.net\/bina-topraklama-hizmeti-edirne\/","title":{"rendered":"Bina Topraklama Hizmeti Edirne"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p><strong>Bina topraklama<\/strong>&nbsp;yap\u0131l\u0131rken, ka\u00e7ak elektrik bir iletken arac\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131yla topra\u011fa verilir. Burada ama\u00e7, cihazlarda olu\u015facak elektrik y\u00fck\u00fc fazlal\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n, yap\u0131lan hat yard\u0131m\u0131yla topra\u011fa iletilmesi ile cihaza temas edecek ki\u015filerin elektrik \u00e7arpmas\u0131ndan kurtar\u0131lmas\u0131d\u0131r. Elektrikli e\u015fyalar ve elektrikle \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan cihazlar\u0131n, elektrik ka\u00e7a\u011f\u0131 riskine kar\u015f\u0131 topraklama yap\u0131larak \u00f6nlem al\u0131n\u0131r.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Bina topraklamas\u0131 nedir? Bina topraklamas\u0131 nas\u0131l yap\u0131l\u0131r?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Elektrik kullan\u0131lan t\u00fcm binalarda hayati tehlike olu\u015fturan elektrik ka\u00e7aklar\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131 bir \u00f6nlem olan topraklaman\u0131n, mutlaka bilin\u00e7li ve i\u015finde uzman ki\u015filer taraf\u0131ndan yap\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekir. \u00dclkemizde topraklama yasal olarak zorunlu k\u0131l\u0131nm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Art\u0131 Elektrik olarak\u00a0<strong>bina topraklama<\/strong>\u00a0konusunda uzman ve deneyimli ekiplerimizle ba\u015fta Edirne ve ihtiya\u00e7 duyulan di\u011fer yerlerde hizmet veriyoruz. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bina Topraklamas\u0131 T\u00fcrleri<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Binalarda can ve mal g\u00fcvenli\u011finin sa\u011flanmas\u0131, \u015febekeleri d\u00fczg\u00fcn \u00e7al\u0131\u015fabilmesi i\u00e7in yap\u0131lan topraklaman\u0131n t\u00fcrleri vard\u0131r.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Koruma Topraklamas\u0131<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Koruma topraklamas\u0131 denilen bu topraklama \u00e7e\u015fidi; kullan\u0131lan elektrikli aletlerin d\u0131\u015flar\u0131ndaki metal k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131n topraklanmas\u0131d\u0131r. Dokunma gerilimi riskine kar\u015f\u0131 di\u011fer canl\u0131lar\u0131 korumak amac\u0131yla ek topraklama yap\u0131l\u0131r. Bu k\u0131s\u0131mlardan elektrik ak\u0131m\u0131 ge\u00e7miyor olsa bile ka\u00e7ak riskine kar\u015f\u0131 topraklama yap\u0131larak elektrik ka\u00e7a\u011f\u0131n\u0131n, dokunan canl\u0131lara iletilmesinin \u00f6n\u00fcne ge\u00e7ilir.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u0130\u015fletme Topraklamas\u0131<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Bu topraklama t\u00fcr\u00fc, tesis ve cihazlar\u0131n do\u011fru \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in gereklidir. Elektrik tesisi olarak faaliyet g\u00f6steren yerlerin i\u015fletme ak\u0131m devrelerine ait bir k\u0131sm\u0131n topraklanmas\u0131 i\u015flemine i\u015fletme topraklamas\u0131; denir. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fonksiyon Topraklamas\u0131<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>\u0130sminden anla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00fczere bir ama\u00e7 do\u011frultusunda yap\u0131lan topraklama \u015feklidir. \u00d6rne\u011fin; y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m \u00e7arpmas\u0131ndan korunmak amac\u0131yla yap\u0131lan topraklama, fonksiyonel topraklamad\u0131r.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bina Topraklama Hizmetimiz<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Bina topraklama<\/strong>&nbsp;i\u015flemi;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Can ve mal g\u00fcvenli\u011finin sa\u011flanmas\u0131<\/li><li>Elektrikli aletlerin g\u00fcvenli\u011finin sa\u011flanmas\u0131<\/li><li>Gerilimin 50 voltun alt\u0131nda tutulmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flamak<\/li><li>Cihazlarda olu\u015fabilecek y\u00fcksek gerilimin d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcr\u00fclmesi<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z t\u00fcm i\u015flemlerde oldu\u011fu gibi bina topraklamas\u0131 konusunda da kaliteli malzemeler se\u00e7iyor, uygulamay\u0131 kalite standartlar\u0131na uygun olarak yap\u0131yoruz. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Topraklama i\u015flemi mutlaka standartlara uygun bir \u015fekilde yap\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r. Do\u011fru topraklama yapt\u0131rmak, binan\u0131z\u0131 ve can\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 korur.&nbsp; <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u0130\u015f yerleri, konutlar ve di\u011fer t\u00fcm binalar i\u00e7in g\u00fcvenilir ve profesyonel topraklama yapt\u0131rmak i\u00e7in bize ula\u015f\u0131n.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/artielektrik.net\/iletisim\/\">Art\u0131 Elektrik \u0130leti\u015fim Sayfas\u0131<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.tredas.com.tr\/icerik\/edirne-131\">Edirne Treda\u015f<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Bina topraklama&nbsp;yap\u0131l\u0131rken, ka\u00e7ak elektrik bir iletken arac\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131yla topra\u011fa verilir. Burada ama\u00e7, cihazlarda olu\u015facak elektrik y\u00fck\u00fc fazlal\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n, yap\u0131lan hat yard\u0131m\u0131yla topra\u011fa iletilmesi ile cihaza temas edecek ki\u015filerin elektrik \u00e7arpmas\u0131ndan kurtar\u0131lmas\u0131d\u0131r. Elektrikli e\u015fyalar ve elektrikle \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan cihazlar\u0131n, elektrik ka\u00e7a\u011f\u0131 riskine kar\u015f\u0131 topraklama yap\u0131larak \u00f6nlem al\u0131n\u0131r.&nbsp;&nbsp; Bina topraklamas\u0131 nedir? Bina topraklamas\u0131 nas\u0131l yap\u0131l\u0131r? Elektrik kullan\u0131lan t\u00fcm binalarda hayati&hellip;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/artielektrik.net\/bina-topraklama-hizmeti-edirne\/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Daha fazlas\u0131n\u0131 oku &raquo;<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Bina Topraklama Hizmeti Edirne<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":190,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"neve_meta_sidebar":"","neve_meta_container":"","neve_meta_enable_content_width":"off